> streamX.leftJoin(tableY, RecordTableY::getForegnKey, joiner).to("output-t=
opic-name")
> =C2=A0
> The left loin on foreign key operation will result in a stream of message=
s from two topics joined on foreign key where 0 or more output message is p=
roduced for each event on the input stream.



