--------------------------------------

             Summary: enrich the authorization error message of connecting to controller
                 Key: KAFKA-18434
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18434
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
