             Summary: Upgrade RocksDB dependency
                 Key: KAFKA-18462
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18462
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Task
          Components: streams
            Reporter: Matthias J. Sax
             Fix For: 4.1.0


We did upgrade RocksDB to 9.7.3 with 4.0 release, but there is already newer RocksDB releases (not available yet for us to use with 4.0 release).

We should re-evaluate if we can upgrade to a newer RocksDB version with 4.1.

When we close this ticket, we should also create a new BLOCKER ticket for a future release as a reminder, so we ensure we upgrade RocksDB regularly.



