Ismael Juma resolved KAFKA-5883.
--------------------------------
    Resolution: Fixed

Java changed the default, so this was effectively done.

> Run tests on Java 9 with =E2=80=93illegal-access=3Ddeny
> ---------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-5883
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-5883
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Task
>          Components: unit tests
>            Reporter: Ismael Juma
>            Priority: Major
>
> The default was changed from =E2=80=93illegal-access=3Ddeny to =E2=80=93i=
llegal-access=3Dwarn late in the Java 9 cycle. By using the former, we will=
 ensure that our code is not relying on functionality that will be removed =
in a future Java version.



