Matthias J. Sax created KAFKA-18478:
---------------------------------------

             Summary: RocksDBTimeOrderedKeyValueBuffer does only use serdes=
 from config
                 Key: KAFKA-18478
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18478
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
          Components: streams
    Affects Versions: 3.6.0
            Reporter: Matthias J. Sax


The newly added stream-table join with grace-period, added a new=C2=A0
RocksDBTimeOrderedKeyValueBuffer store.
=C2=A0
This new store's key and value serializers are not initialized correctly, b=
ut are always `null`, resulting in falling back to use the serdes from Stre=
amsConfig.
=C2=A0
Thus, serdes passed via `Joined` are ignored.



