Pramithas, you may be encountering a security setting we have in our
GitHub. Only PRs from committers and certain community members will
automatically run. Other PRs will need a committer to manually approve or
add the "ci-approved" label before the workflow will run.

It looks like your recent PR has the necessary label applied
https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/18525

If you want to re-trigger the CI you can just push an empty commit to your
PR.

Hope this helps,
David A

