Hey Everyone,

Recently I've noticed a trend of new KIPs that are under discussion or
still being worked on (in draft) being posted to the "adopted" section at
the top of the page which is very confusing. This seems to be getting worse
and worse.

I hesitate to modify the wiki page and move someone else's entry but this
should be cleaned up so is it ok to just move these to the right section?

Chris

--00000000000069d57f062bc7d86d--

