Andrew Schofield resolved KAFKA-18558.
--------------------------------------
    Resolution: Fixed

> Include partitions from previous subscription in ShareFetchRequest only for non-empty acknowledgements.
> -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-18558
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18558
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Sub-task
>            Reporter: Shivsundar R
>            Assignee: Shivsundar R
>            Priority: Major
>             Fix For: 4.1.0
