Juma made a valid point in the Jira ticket: "we cannot change the client upgr=
ade guarantees outside of a major release." To avoid blocking the 4.0 release=
, this thread should focus on the "client upgrade path." We can create a sepa=
rate ticket to discuss the advanced compatibility policy.

Additionally, we need to upgrade e2e (and docs) according to the client upgra=
de path

Best,
