Hi Anton,
I think this is a good idea given that the change is binary-compatible and =
it
makes it more clear that both brokers and controllers are represented in th=
e
response.

Personally, I think this should be a very small KIP so that we can properly
review and sign off on making the change. I know that some other projects
generate code from the Kafka protocol RPC schemas, so having a KIP that doc=
uments
the change and then is included in a specific release will help there too.

Thanks,
Andrew

