             Summary: Add validation for advertised listeners
                 Key: KAFKA-18624
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18624
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Divij Vaidya
            Assignee: Jason Taylor


Users of Apache Kafka can configure the advertised listeners =C2=A0[1]on ea=
ch broker. It is possible to set an incorrect configuration here. The updat=
ed (incorrect) configuration becomes effective on next restart of the broke=
r.

The motivation is this Jira is to fail fast for cases where we are 100% sur=
e that the added configuration is incorrect. The validation should be added=
 near to [https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/410065a65df2716e563429577dc2=
d3bcaa0c7c9a/core/src/main/scala/kafka/server/KafkaConfig.scala#L649]=20

The implementor of this ticket can choose the validations that we should in=
clude, but as a starter, we can fail the config update if all the brokers h=
ave the same advertised listener.=C2=A0


[1] [https://kafka.apache.org/documentation.html#brokerconfigs_advertised.l=
isteners]=C2=A0



