Almog Gavra created KAFKA-18626:
-----------------------------------

             Summary: Support for windows that are more flexible to late arriving data
                 Key: KAFKA-18626
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18626
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: New Feature
          Components: streams
            Reporter: Almog Gavra
            Assignee: Almog Gavra


This ticket suggests adding more flexible window types that are not sensitive to timestamps that are late arriving or out of order.

See [https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1127+Add+StreamTimeWindow+to+Kafka+Streams] for more information



