Hi David,

+1 for adding KAFKA-18627
<https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18627> in v4.0.0.

Besides, I'd also like to ask if we can include KAFKA-18230
<https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18230> into v4.0.0?
The impact of KAFKA-18230
<https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18230> is that the admin
client will fail to work if the active controller changed. That affects
some applications that will create 1 admin client at first and use it for
all the admin tasks. The change is low risk with only 10 lines of change +
many tests.

Thank you.
Luke

