Lucas Brutschy created KAFKA-18651:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Core streams-specific broker configurations
                 Key: KAFKA-18651
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18651
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
          Components: streams
            Reporter: Lucas Brutschy
            Assignee: Bill Bejeck


We need to add the following core subset of broker configurations (some may=
 already be there):

Broker configs:

```
group.coordinator.rebalance.protocols  =E2=80=93 add value streams to enabl=
e streams rebalance protocol
group.streams.session.timeout.ms
group.streams.heartbeat.interval.ms
group.streams.num.standby.replicas
```

We need to make sure that `num.standby.replicas` is passed with `assignment=
Configs` to the assignor.=20

As defined in the KIP.



