> As per KIP we should rotate the fetch partitions
> =C2=A0
> [https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=3D25507=
0434#KIP932:QueuesforKafka-Fetchingandacknowledgingrecords]
> =C2=A0
> _In order to ensure no share-partitions are starved from records being fe=
tched, the share-partition leader rotates the order of share-partitions for=
 which it returns partition information. This ensures that it eventually re=
turns data about all partitions for which data is available._



