>>>
>>> I have a use case where source connectors need to send metrics and logs
>>> to a custom Kafka topic. Although it's possible to use a log reporter t=
o
>>> extract the required information from logs, there are several limitatio=
ns
>>> to consider:
>>> - It depends on the log format used in `*kafka-runtime*`.
>>> - A pluggable interface provides greater flexibility for defining custo=
m
>>> behavior.
>>> - The API will have better support in future releases of `
>>> *kafka-connect*`.
>>>
