now attaching to the Kafka broker with gdb and forcing the TCP_NODELAY to 0
again using

    set $val = (int*)malloc(4)
    p *$val=0
    p (int) setsockopt(202, 6, 1, $val, 4)

we see the traffic is much more efficient:

