I am setting up multiple Kafka Connect (KC) clusters on Amazon ECS, each wi=
th 2 nodes and one connector per cluster.

When all KC clusters and connectors are created simultaneously, one of the =
connectors unexpectedly restarts. The issue is reproducible with min of 4 c=
lusters. One of the KC clusters connector is only restarted event the clust=
er count is increased to 10.=C2=A0

