David Jacot created KAFKA-18672:
-----------------------------------

             Summary: CoordinatorRecordSerde must validate value versions
                 Key: KAFKA-18672
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18672
             Project: Kafka
